{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quit your soul-sucking job, take a risky loan, and chase your culinary dream with Red the Cook!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop, fry, mix, and hustle your way through the day in a <strong>cozy cooking simulator</strong> that blends <strong>restaurant and time management, ingredient crafting.</strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Time Management:</strong> Cook and serve under pressure before your guests lose patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082490/extras/23b4d7ca38335a140a55efab73d62752.poster.avif?t=1773222201\" width=634 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082490/extras/23b4d7ca38335a140a55efab73d62752.webm?t=1773222201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082490/extras/23b4d7ca38335a140a55efab73d62752.mp4?t=1773222201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Ingredient Crafting:</strong> Combine fresh produce and spices to unlock all recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082490/extras/e9d00009ee633129f0e9e378d2f243f2.poster.avif?t=1773222201\" width=634 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082490/extras/e9d00009ee633129f0e9e378d2f243f2.webm?t=1773222201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082490/extras/e9d00009ee633129f0e9e378d2f243f2.mp4?t=1773222201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Adorable Guests:</strong> From fluffy regulars to strange locals - everyone\u2019s got an appetite.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082490/extras/40e80fac2afce199961e3d215133e347.avif?t=1773222201\" width=635 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Cozy Vibe, Comedic Chaos:</strong> Lighthearted humor and a warm, slightly odd world to explore.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082490/extras/ef158229e954dfa0f42af7736b856457.apng?t=1773222201\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082490/extras/ef158229e954dfa0f42af7736b856457.poster.avif?t=1773222201\" class=\"bb_img\" width=635 height=197 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to cook, serve, and build Red\u2019s dream restaurant - one plate at a time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082490?t=1773222201","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082490?t=1773222201","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082490/561fa8e221d08f6ceec5a98ebb4c97b5daab2823/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773222201","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082490/561fa8e221d08f6ceec5a98ebb4c97b5daab2823/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773222201","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4163180,"description